I've been playing nethack for roughly ten years.  I've previously
sniffed the Amulet of Yendor all of TWICE.  On the first occassion, I
got two levels up before being barbecued by a black dragon.  The second
time, I had JUST REACHED the high altar (and was wearing an "AoLS) when
Death, Pestilence, Famine (and friends!) rudely informed me before I
had a chance to #offer that "Today is most definately NOT your day."

The following is a (hopefully entertaining) tale of disgustingly good
luck.

