The donjon of Ashikaga Takauji was extremely stressful.  Serra knew
that one blow from the Tsurugi of Muramasa just might cut her in half.
Fortunately, Serra's +7 tsurugi kept Ashikaga Takauji at bay long
enough to chase him to the upstair (one hit was enough to force him to
teleport and heal), then displace him and finally kill him.

She knew this wasn't the best way to deal with someone carrying such a
dangerous weapon, but didn't have a better method (no /oDeath) and knew
she was very lucky to survive (especially since she didn't have an
"oLifeSaving).

