The ascention run was fairly straightforward, except Serra got hungry
much much faster than made sense (95 turns from Satiated to Hungry).
This prompted a reading of the blessed spellbook of source.  After a
while, she learned that #jumping made one morehungry(rnd(25));  After
checking her food supply, Serre decided that she wouldn't be jumping
all over hell anymore.

The remainder of the run from the sanctum to the dungeon was a breeze:
Only three random intra-level teleports in Gehennom, four malignant
auras, and one Wizard appearance.  He escaped upstairs before being
bisected again (isn't he getting tired of this?, Serra asked herself).

